 <section id="mislabel">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="num">03</span><h2>Mislabel watchlist</h2></div>
  <p class="lede">Nine phrases that appear in NBFC releases and vendor decks, decoded. Use with the diligence script in §08.</p>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
   <thead><tr><th>What the release says</th><th>What it usually is</th><th>Class</th><th>Why it’s not agentic</th></tr></thead>
   <tbody><tr><td class="ml-say">“AI-powered KYC / onboarding”</td><td>OCR extraction + face match</td><td><span class="chip chip-multi">C1/C2</span></td><td class="ml-why">Reads and matches. No autonomous action.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ml-say">“AI-driven verification”</td><td>CIBIL / CKYC / GST / penny-drop calls</td><td><span class="chip chip-C0">C0</span></td><td class="ml-why">Integration plumbing. Not a model.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ml-say">“AI underwriting”</td><td>Scorecard + rule engine</td><td><span class="chip chip-multi">C2/C0</span></td><td class="ml-why">Predicts a score, applies fixed rules.</td></tr>
