<tr><td class="ml-say">“AI risk / early-warning”</td><td>Delinquency model on a dashboard</td><td><span class="chip chip-C2">C2</span></td><td class="ml-why">Forecasts; does not act.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ml-say">“Agentic credit memo”</td><td>LLM drafts from human-fed inputs</td><td><span class="chip chip-C3">C3</span></td><td class="ml-why">Agentic only if it sources inputs.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ml-say">“Agentic voice collections”</td><td>Speech + NLU reminder calls</td><td><span class="chip chip-multi">C3/C0</span></td><td class="ml-why">Executes a script, not a plan.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ml-say">“AI fraud / AML”</td><td>Anomaly ML + rules</td><td><span class="chip chip-multi">C2/C0</span></td><td class="ml-why">Flags; human investigates and decides.</td></tr>
