   <div class="vcard bad"><h3>✕ Substance is C1–C3; the C4 layer is thin and shrinking</h3><p>Deployed: voice analytics, bots, face CV, document IDP, GenAI SDLC. Agentic: 27 live agents vs a 600+ FY27 target cut from 800+, scoped to internal ops — not the credit decision. Microsite is future-tense branding; only earnings disclosures are falsifiable.</p></div>
