 <section id="diligence">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="num">08</span><h2>Vendor diligence script — ten questions</h2></div>
  <p class="lede">Ask these of any vendor claiming “agentic AI.” Questions 1 and 8 alone eliminate most of the mislabel watchlist.</p>
  <ol class="dil"><li>Show me the agent’s action log for one real production case, end to end. (No log = no agent.)</li>
<li>Which steps can it execute without human approval, and what are the hard limits per action?</li>
<li>What is the per-decision explainability output — reason codes, feature attributions — and in what format do we get it for RBI audit?</li>
<li>What happens when the LLM is down or wrong? Show the fallback path and the kill-switch.</li>
<li>How many Indian regulated entities run this in production (not pilot)? Name two we can call.</li>
<li>Where is inference hosted, where does our data rest, and what is the retention/deletion policy under DPDP?</li>
<li>What is the drift-monitoring cadence and who is alerted?</li>
<li>If your ‘agent’ is a workflow of API calls + a scorecard, say so — price it as C0/C2, not C4.</li>
<li>What conduct guardrails exist for customer-facing actions (frequency caps, timing windows, language)?</li>
<li>Contractually: who is liable when the agent errs? (FREE-AI says we are — so your indemnity and audit-rights clauses matter.)</li></ol>
 </section>

 <section id="roadmap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="num">09</span><h2>12-month execution roadmap</h2></div>
  <p class="lede">Sequenced so every quarter ships something usable while building the FREE-AI base that unlocks the next quarter.</p>
  <article class="road"><div class="road-head"><span class="road-q">Q1 (0–90 days)</span><h3>Foundations + first agent</h3></div><ul><li>FREE-AI gap assessment against the 10-point checklist below; assign owners.</li><li>Ship portfolio-monitoring v1: NL queries + threshold alerts on one product’s book.</li><li>Deploy C3 RAG policy assistant for compliance (45–60 days).</li><li>Baseline metrics: underwriting TAT, cost per serviced query, roll-rates by bucket.</li></ul></article>
<article class="road"><div class="road-head"><span class="road-q">Q2 (3–6 months)</span><h3>Buy the mature slices</h3></div><ul><li>C3 servicing assistant live on top-20 intents (no state changes).</li><li>Collections: propensity bucketing + script-bounded multilingual reminder bot.</li><li>Stand up reason-code + immutable audit logging in the LOS path (FREE-AI + future C4 gate).</li><li>Run vendor diligence (script below) on 2–3 underwriting co-pilot vendors — evaluation only.</li></ul></article>
<article class="road"><div class="road-head"><span class="road-q">Q3–Q4 (6–12 months)</span><h3>Deepen + decide</h3></div><ul><li>Portfolio co-pilot v2: cross-product queries, drift alerts, monthly risk-pack automation.</li><li>Board-approved AI policy + model inventory (FREE-AI expectation; also your licence to scale).</li><li>Re-test the underwriting trigger: volume, data completeness, vendor explainability. If met → narrow bought pilot on ONE product line.</li><li>Quarterly tracker: Bajaj/L&amp;T/Tata agentic disclosures — count live agents and scope, not announcements.</li></ul></article>
 </section>

 <section id="freeai">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="num">10</span><h2>FREE-AI readiness checklist</h2></div>
  <p class="lede">Ten items, each with the evidence an examiner would ask for and a suggested owner. This list is simultaneously your compliance posture and your licence to deploy anything C4.</p>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
   <thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Evidence to produce</th><th>Owner</th></tr></thead>
   <tbody><tr><td class="fa-item">Board-approved AI policy</td><td class="fa-ev">Policy doc + board minute</td><td class="fa-own">CTO / Company Secretary</td></tr>
<tr><td class="fa-item">Model inventory (all C2+ models)</td><td class="fa-ev">Register with owner, version, validation date</td><td class="fa-own">Head of Risk</td></tr>
<tr><td class="fa-item">Per-decision reason codes on credit models</td><td class="fa-ev">Sample decision file with codes</td><td class="fa-own">Head of Credit</td></tr>
<tr><td class="fa-item">Bias / fairness testing</td><td class="fa-ev">Test report per model, refreshed annually</td><td class="fa-own">Risk / Data Science</td></tr>
<tr><td class="fa-item">Immutable audit logs on decisions &amp; agent actions</td><td class="fa-ev">Log extract for any given loan ID</td><td class="fa-own">CTO</td></tr>
